                                "sense_id": "f5651358-8f68-38bb-b770-235fc867cffb",
                                "text": "John F Kennedy’s secret talks with Soviet intelligence, surreptitious tape recordings and “girlfriend system” create a new portrait of a cunning and cagey JFK, according to a historian who has researched a treasure trove of recently released recordings and papers of the late president."
                            }
                        ]
